    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom&amp;tag=0.0.1#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Y1 \u00b7 Type A**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/releases/download/0.0.1/rom-windows.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/releases/download/0.0.1/rom-linux.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/releases/download/0.0.1/rom-macos.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\nThis is a release of Linux for the Innioasis Y1 intended for developers to create novel experiences on the Innioasis Y1 audio player.\r\n\r\nCredit to @palutenfan123 for building this.\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"cc4dbcf6e6e0e6112aa080535063e3d9f08956049ab24faa0c2b06e8f67ae681\",\"size\":644364523,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"69b0e3133a1e51